  "body": "Brand New | Freehold | No Body Corporate Fees | 10-Year Halo Guarantee | Top School Zones\r\n\r\nMotivated Vendor – All Reasonable Offers Considered!\r\n\r\nLooking for a spacious, brand-new home in a prime North Shore location, with beautiful sea views and excellent investment potential?\r\n\r\nDiscover this beautifully designed two-bedroom home at 124 Arran Road, Browns Bay, offering a generous 93sqm floor area, modern comfort and an enviable coastal lifestyle.\r\n\r\nWhether you're a first-home buyer, downsizer or property investor, this home offers an exciting combination of space, location and long-term appeal.\r\n\r\nWhat Makes This Home Stand Out?\r\n\r\n• Generous 93sqm Floor Area – Spacious two-bedroom living with a practical, modern layout.\r\n• Beautiful Sea Views – Enjoy relaxing coastal outlooks from your own home.\r\n• Excellent School Zones – Including Rangitoto College, Browns Bay School and Murrays Bay Intermediate.\r\n• Dedicated Car Park – Convenient off-street parking.\r\n• Freehold Title & No Body Corporate Fees – Enjoy independent ownership without ongoing body corporate fees.\r\n• 10-Year Halo Guarantee – Added protection and peace of mind.\r\n• Brand-New & Low Maintenance – Contemporary finishes, quality appliances and easy-care living.\r\n• Prime Browns Bay Location – Close to beautiful beaches, cafés, shops and everyday amenities.\r\n\r\nAn Attractive Investment Opportunity!\r\n\r\nWith a rental appraisal of $700–$730 per week, this property offers potential annual gross rental income of approximately $36,400–$37,960.\r\n\r\nFor investors seeking a modern, low-maintenance property in a desirable North Shore location, this home is well worth considering.\r\n\r\nA Spacious Home. A Smart Investment. A Fantastic Location.\r\n\r\nOur Vendor Is Highly Motivated and Ready to Sell!\r\n\r\nAll reasonable offers will be seriously considered.\r\n\r\nDon't miss your opportunity to secure a spacious, brand-new home with sea views in this sought-after location.\r\n\r\nContact us today to arrange your private viewing!\r\n\r\nRental appraisal is indicative only and does not guarantee future rental income. Actual returns depend on the purchase price, expenses and occupancy.",
